# Push and deploy when done

When a task is finished (features, fixes, restyles):

1. Commit relevant changes (no secrets; no Co-authored-by trailers).
2. Push to `origin` (`main` unless on another branch).
3. Deploy production with Vercel using the saved token from `C:\Users\tando\.skysteaks\credentials.env` (`npx vercel@latest --prod --yes --token …`).

Do this by default at the end of completed work without waiting to be asked again. Production URL: https://skystakebet.com (fallback https://skysteaks.vercel.app).
